<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0134_D47PC0101_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">People who come to a Trap House\ntake good care of their homies.\fAin’t that right?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0134_D47PC0101_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">After a long hike in the mountains\nlookin’ for a Trap House, when you\f’bout to fall flat...\rThen it feel like paradise!</language>
	</row>
</body>
